OL,3,AHow important are Nvidia and Jensen    
OL,4,AHuang to the US economy?               
OL,6,FThat partnership has now ended         
OL,7,Ffollowing Huang's resignation over     
OL,8,Frevelations of extramarital affairs,   
OL,9,Fone of which is alleged to have been   
OL,10,Fwith a Chinese spy.                    
OL,12,FThe company has been rocked by the     
OL,13,Fscandal, with hundreds of billions of  
OL,14,Fdollars wiped off its stock market     
OL,15,Fvalue and questions swirling about the 
OL,16,Fextent of the impact of Huang's        
OL,17,Fdeparture.                             
